    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/6606d77e9f4c60feec2940c4e40a57a0.avif?t=1749517870\" width=800 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super One More Jump is an intense arcade platformer with a simple twist\u2014it's just one button! Easy-to-learn, impossible to put down, and even harder to master. Just-one-more jump your way through handcrafted, gravity-defying levels that ramp up in complexity and creative mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/680a7b8588c70454e9a4fd685b4dfbd9.poster.avif?t=1749517870\" width=616 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/680a7b8588c70454e9a4fd685b4dfbd9.webm?t=1749517870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including a huge selection of challenge levels, high score chasing modes and a select few impossible challenges to master. Further test your skill with gameplay remix modifiers that give levels an extra challenging twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/0acfebd2ae57b22b9d15c8a80243e25c.poster.avif?t=1749517870\" width=616 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/0acfebd2ae57b22b9d15c8a80243e25c.webm?t=1749517870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/0acfebd2ae57b22b9d15c8a80243e25c.mp4?t=1749517870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/9604c692bb412c6f854667aff6e49bd9.poster.avif?t=1749517870\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/9604c692bb412c6f854667aff6e49bd9.webm?t=1749517870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/9604c692bb412c6f854667aff6e49bd9.mp4?t=1749517870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/94eee27d59415ac63d1c4a36793d8106.poster.avif?t=1749517870\" width=616 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/94eee27d59415ac63d1c4a36793d8106.webm?t=1749517870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four players, one button each. Can you work together to beat the 80 co-op challenges?\u00a0<i>(Supports 2-4 local players)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends with the included local split screen endless mode. (<i>Supports 2 local players)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/ab098c9f6cc11091bd9f19d850c7f78b.poster.avif?t=1749517870\" width=614 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/ab098c9f6cc11091bd9f19d850c7f78b.webm?t=1749517870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/ab098c9f6cc11091bd9f19d850c7f78b.mp4?t=1749517870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/da90ece37f61a142e1ca1f068432b754.poster.avif?t=1749517870\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/da90ece37f61a142e1ca1f068432b754.apng?t=1749517870\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=50 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guest pixel artists from some of our favourite indie games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/2bfc6457d5dace258ff50fdd7b8f2148.avif?t=1749517870\" width=616 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your mood with the included soundtracks:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New music soundtrack featuring 18 tracks by Space Bwoi</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original music soundtrack by Batterie</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/e0bc82c80268f849299b754eac6d7a5d.poster.avif?t=1749517870\" width=616 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/e0bc82c80268f849299b754eac6d7a5d.webm?t=1749517870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/e0bc82c80268f849299b754eac6d7a5d.mp4?t=1749517870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/d16690d498f13f1f2e50f50b7d9e979c.poster.avif?t=1749517870\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/d16690d498f13f1f2e50f50b7d9e979c.apng?t=1749517870\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=50 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access to community created levels</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access to community created custom pixel themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Included level editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/4faf8aecc7220176b49fe4030ace0204.poster.avif?t=1749517870\" width=614 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/4faf8aecc7220176b49fe4030ace0204.webm?t=1749517870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/4faf8aecc7220176b49fe4030ace0204.mp4?t=1749517870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features</u></strong>\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+ Hand crafted levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge modes for each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circuit mode\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-4 player local co-op mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 player local competitive mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New music soundtrack by Space Bwoi</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original music soundtrack by Batterie</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your game with easily unlockable themes and avatars from some of our favorite pixel artists: Toby Dixon (@tbdxn), Ilija Melentijevic (@iLkKke), Cocefi (@chickysprout), Sven 'ptoing' Ruthner (@the_ptoing), Mister Hk (@mr_hk_), Stephane Boutin (@JGSBoutain), Helm (@helm_ll), Anders Gullmarsvik (@itchabop), Ian Cid (@skydevilpalm)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workshop support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Included level editor</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/6606d77e9f4c60feec2940c4e40a57a0.avif?t=1749517870\" width=800 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super One More Jump is an intense arcade platformer with a simple twist\u2014it's just one button! Easy-to-learn, impossible to put down, and even harder to master. Just-one-more jump your way through handcrafted, gravity-defying levels that ramp up in complexity and creative mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/680a7b8588c70454e9a4fd685b4dfbd9.poster.avif?t=1749517870\" width=616 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/680a7b8588c70454e9a4fd685b4dfbd9.webm?t=1749517870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including a huge selection of challenge levels, high score chasing modes and a select few impossible challenges to master. Further test your skill with gameplay remix modifiers that give levels an extra challenging twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/0acfebd2ae57b22b9d15c8a80243e25c.poster.avif?t=1749517870\" width=616 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/0acfebd2ae57b22b9d15c8a80243e25c.webm?t=1749517870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/0acfebd2ae57b22b9d15c8a80243e25c.mp4?t=1749517870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/9604c692bb412c6f854667aff6e49bd9.poster.avif?t=1749517870\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/9604c692bb412c6f854667aff6e49bd9.webm?t=1749517870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/9604c692bb412c6f854667aff6e49bd9.mp4?t=1749517870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/94eee27d59415ac63d1c4a36793d8106.poster.avif?t=1749517870\" width=616 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/94eee27d59415ac63d1c4a36793d8106.webm?t=1749517870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four players, one button each. Can you work together to beat the 80 co-op challenges?\u00a0<i>(Supports 2-4 local players)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends with the included local split screen endless mode. (<i>Supports 2 local players)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556830/extras/ab098c9f6cc11091bd9f19